  [archived]`);\n--- suggest ---\n12:// With a description, an already grouped track is scored against each declared\n41:// A map destination has to be NNN-slug. The relocation preflight refuses any\n153:// Every folder already in the track, declared or not. A proposed group may not\n154:// reuse one: the relocation preflight refuses a destination that exists without\n254:function nameGroups(groups, termsByFolder, existingFolders) {\n255:  const used = new Set(existingFolders);\n296:      process.stdout.write(`track ${track}: packet ${folder} is not NNN-slug and must be renamed first\\n`);\n"}
