skills/sk-doc/sk-create-feature-catalog/SKILL.md:291:7. Include source-file and validation anchors for every feature claim.\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-feature-catalog/SKILL.md:295:11. Run shared validation on the root catalog and per-feature leaves before delivery.\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-feature-catalog/SKILL.md:313:13. Never omit `trigger_phrases` from per-feature frontmatter.\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-feature-catalog/SKILL.md:332:| Missing source anchors | Catalog claims become hard to audit | Add implementation and validation file references in the per-feature file |\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-feature-catalog/SKILL.md:334:| Playbook cross-references drifting from catalog names | Inventory and validation no longer match | Update catalog and playbook links together when a feature name changes |\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-feature-catalog/SKILL.md:336:| Missing `trigger_phrases` in frontmatter | Feature is invisible to doc-trigger routing | Add at least three trigger phrases matching the H3 heading in the root catalog |\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-feature-catalog/SKILL.md:347:- Each per-feature file carries frontmatter with a stable title, description, at least three `trigger_phrases`, and a four-part version, plus source-file and validation or test anchors for every feature claim.\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-feature-catalog/SKILL.md:349:- Shared validation ran clean on the root catalog and each per-feature leaf, and cross-file links, source anchors, and root-entry-to-feature-file parity were verified by hand.\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-feature-catalog/SKILL.md:363:- `../shared/references/validation.md` - shared validation and quality-scoring workflow.\n.skilled/skills/sk-doc/sk-create-feature-catalog/SKILL.md:364:- `../sk-create-frontmatter/references/frontmatter-versioning.md` - four-part version field rules.\n"}
