acket-relocation.md) |\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:249:| 493 | Sub-track proposal | [493](tooling-and-scripts/sub-track-proposal.md) | [sub-track-proposal](../feature-catalog/tooling-and-scripts/sub-track-proposal.md) |\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/manual-testing-playbook.md:336:| 494 | Ripgrep archive search | [494](retrieval/rg-archive-search.md) | [rg-archive-search](../feature-catalog/retrieval/rg-archive-search.md) |\n"}
