- What Failed: add.\n- Ruled Out: update with the three directions (reducer used them as exhausted; the section is still placeholder).\n- Next Focus: concise security focus.\n- Cross-reference status: update table (spec_code partial, checklist_evidence pass, feature_catalog_code partial, skill_agent pending, playbook_capability pending/notApplicable).\n- Files under review: maybe add a coverage table. The reducer doesn't manage it. I'll add a concise table listing the doc surfaces covered/deferred. But editing a large chunk; use edit on specific sections.\n\nLet me edit the strategy's \"What Worked\", \"What Failed\", \"Ruled Out\", \"Next Focus\", \"Cross-reference\" sections. Use edit calls (targeted). Then continue to iteration 2.\n\nFirst fix next-focus."}
