eate.sh:1813 is the only phase-numbering loop; phase-definitions.md:255 and quick-reference.md:265 are the two guidance lines.', affectedSurfaceHints: ['phase-definitions.md adding a phase','quick-reference.md phased packets','create.sh phase numbering'], claim: 'The phase guidance says next sequential without stating that z_archive phases count.' },\n  { id: 'F008', severity: 'P2', title: 'SKILL.md script list omits the relocation, proposal and archive entrypoints', file: '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/SKILL.md:317', findingClass: 'instance-only', scopeProof: 'grep -n \"relocate|suggest-subtracks|archive\" SKILL.md returns only the :287 mention.', affectedSurfaceHints: ['SKILL.md Quick Reference Commands','SKILL.md references list'], claim: 'The SKILL.md script list omits relocate.mjs, suggest-subtracks.mjs and archive.sh.' },\n  { id: 'F009', severity: 'P2', title: 'Changelog exit-code and archive-JSON paragraphs predate phases 008 and 009', file: '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/changelog/v2.13.0.0.md:67', findingClass: 'cross-consumer', scopeProof: 'The changelog is the release contract; relocate.mjs:34-38 and rg-wrapper.mjs:380-382 are the behaviours it names incompletely.', affectedSurfaceHints: ['changelog Moving Packets','changelog Archive Search and Validation'], claim: 'The changelog omits status 3 and archivedPaths.' }\n];\nconst record = {\n  type: 'iteration', iteration: 3, mode: 'review', target_agent: 'deep-review', agent_definition_loaded: true,\n  resolved_route: 'Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review', run: 3, status: 'complete',\n  focus: 'traceability + operator documentation focus', dimensions: ['traceability'],\n  filesReviewed: [\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/SKILL.md:280-319',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/structure/folder-structure.md:97-153',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/structure/phase-definitions.md:240-260',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/workflows/quick-re