ture reference lists three non-answer cases and omits the phase 009 non-NNN-slug refusal.'],\n  ['F007','P2','Phase guidance does not say an archived phase counts when numbering a new one','.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/references/structure/phase-definitions.md:255','cross-consumer','The phase guidance says next sequential without stating that z_archive phases count.'],\n  ['F008','P2','SKILL.md script list omits the relocation, proposal and archive entrypoints','.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/SKILL.md:317','instance-only','The SKILL.md script list omits relocate.mjs, suggest-subtracks.mjs and archive.sh.'],\n  ['F009','P2','Changelog exit-code and archive-JSON paragraphs predate phases 008 and 009','.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/changelog/v2.13.0.0.md:67','cross-consumer','The changelog omits status 3 and archivedPaths.'],\n  ['F010','P2','Relocation catalog rewrite step still describes only whole-path ids','.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/tooling-and-scripts/spec-packet-relocation.md:44','instance-only','The catalog omits the bare sibling-name and pre-archive id rewrites added in phase 007.'],\n  ['F011','P2','Archive-search catalog says path recipe paths stay plain strings and never names archivedPaths','.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/retrieval/rg-archive-search.md:28','cross-consumer','The catalog omits the archivedPaths field beside paths.'],\n  ['F012','P2','Relocation playbook has no status-3 or resume scenario','.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/tooling-and-scripts/spec-packet-relocation.md:226','instance-only','The playbook Pass/Fail row never exercises the late-step resume or status 3.'],\n  ['F013','P2','Proposal playbook never feeds the printed map to the relocation preflight','.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/tooling-and-scripts/sub-track-proposal.md:169','instance-only','The playbook never runs relocate.mjs --map and has no non-NNN-slug fixture.'],\n  ['F014','P2','Archive-search playbook Pass/Fail row checks text output only and not the path JSON record','.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/retrieval/rg-archive-search.md:176','instance-only','The playbook never asserts archivedPaths on the path recipe.']\n];\nconst active = base.map(([id,severity,title,file,findingClass,claim]) => ({ id, severity, title, file, findingClass, scopeProof: 'Source evidence is recorded in the iteration narrative for this finding.', affectedSurfaceHints: [], claim }));\nconst record = {\n  type: 'iteration', iteration: 4, mode: 'review', target_agent: 'deep-review', agent_definition_loaded: true,\n  resolved_route: 'Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review', run: 4, status: 'complete',\n  focus: 'maintainability + operator documentation focus', dimensions: ['maintainability'],\n  filesReviewed: [\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/tooling-and-scripts/spec-packet-relocation.md:13-104',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/retrieval/rg-archive-search.md:13-67',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/feature-catalog/feature-catalog.md:660-750,1060-1090',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/tooling-and-scripts/spec-packet-relocation.md:23-235',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/tooling-and-scripts/sub-track-proposal.md:23-177',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/manual-testing-playbook/retrieval/rg-archive-search.md:23-185',\n    '.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/README.md:610-641',\n    'README.md:400-435,1195-1210',\n    'AGENTS.md:70-85'\n  ],\n  findingsCount: 14, findingsSummary: { P0: 0, P1: 4, P2: 10 },\n  findingsNew: active.slice(9), findingDetails: active,\n  traceabilityChecks: {\n    summary: { required: 2, executed: 2, pass: 2, partial: 0, fail: 0, blocked: 0, notApplicable: 0, gatingFailures: 0 },\n    results: [\n      { protocol: 'spec_code', level: 'core', status: 'pass', evidence: 'code behaviours match the phase 006-010 goals; F010-F014 are doc-surface gaps' },\n      { protocol: 'checklist_evidence', level: 'core', status: 'pass', evidence: 'phase 005-010 tasks.md evidence rows' },\n      { protocol: 'feature_catalog_code', level: 'overlay', status: 'partial', evidence: 'spec-packet-relocation.md:44, rg-archive-search.md:28, spec-lifecycle-automation.md:45' },\n      { protocol: 'playbook_capability', level: 'overlay', status: 'partial', evidence: 'playbooks 492:226, 493:169, 494:176, 237:212-230' }\n    ]\n  },\n  newFindingsRatio: 0.1667,\n  noveltyJustification: 'Five new P2 findings add 5 of 30 accumulated severity weight; the catalog/playbook layer is a new surface, not a repeat of the reference findings.',\n  sessionId: 'fanout-dsh-2-1794652127582-mfqldk', generation: 1, lineageMode: 'new', timestamp: ts, durationMs: 300000\n};\nconst lines = [JSON.stringify(record)];\nfor (const f of active.slice(9)) lines.push(JSON.stringify({ type: 'finding', id: f.id, severity: f.severity, title: f.title, file: f.file, iteration: 4, findingClass: f.findingClass, claim: f.claim }));\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({ type: 'classification', detail: 'maintainability: feature catalog rewrite/JSON claims and three playbook contracts lag; system README, root README, AGENTS.md and the track-root page are current.', iteration: 4 }));\nfor (const r of record.traceabilityChecks.results) lines.push(JSON.stringify({ type: 'traceability_check', protocol: r.protocol, level: r.level, status: r.status, evidence: r.evidence, iteration: 4 }));\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({ type: 'ruled_out', direction: 'structural README or playbook format violation', reason: 'required sections, links and verification rows are present; the gaps are behavioural coverage.', iteration: 4 }));\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({ type: 'ruled_out', direction: 'feature registration gap', reason: 'feature-catalog.md:678-694 and :1082 register both features; the current-state text is the gap.', iteration: 4 }));\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(dir, 'deltas', 'iter-004.jsonl'), lines.join('\\n') + '\\n');\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(dir, '.gateway-events', 'iter-004.json'), JSON.stringify(record) + '\\n');\nconsole.log('delta lines', lines.length);\nEOF","description":"Write iteration 4 delta and gateway event"}}
