e P1 and 11 P2; root README, AGENTS.md, worked-examples, track-root page, validation-rule-engine page and validation playbook need no change.', iteration: 5 }));\nfor (const r of record.traceabilityChecks.results) lines.push(JSON.stringify({ type: 'traceability_check', protocol: r.protocol, level: r.level, status: r.status, evidence: r.evidence, iteration: 5 }));\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({ type: 'ruled_out', direction: 'single consolidated stale-docs finding', reason: 'operator asked for exact file:line per gap; surface owners differ.', iteration: 5 }));\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({ type: 'ruled_out', direction: 'reopening the phase-column residual', reason: 'decision-record.md records it as accepted out of scope.', iteration: 5 }));\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(dir, 'deltas', 'iter-005.jsonl'), lines.join('\\n') + '\\n');\nfs.writeFileSync(path.join(dir, '.gateway-events', 'iter-005.json'), JSON.stringify(record) + '\\n');\nconsole.log('delta lines', lines.length);\nEOF","description":"Write iteration 5 delta and gateway event"}}
